  "description": "Complete reverse-engineered specification for AIRA Modular patches: SysEx protocol (RQ1/DT1), main module, 6 sub-module slots, 31-submodule catalog with jack maps, virtual cable operations and cable-condition bitmasks. Shared by the AIRA patch editor and ABDBankManager.",
