  "brandLogo": "brands/roland-logo.svg",
  "modelImage": "models/roland-airamodular.webp",
  "source": "Unofficial MIDI Implementation v1.2 by mugenkidou (reverse engineering). Verify write behaviour against hardware before production use.",
  "notes": [
    "The 4 AIRA Modular devices share the same internal DSP engine and the same patch format; only the Model ID byte differs.",
    "The shared engine has 6 slots; any of the 31 submodules can be loaded into any slot on any of the 4 devices.",
    "Type IDs 0x0F (MIDI CLOCK TO GATE) and 0x10 (SHORT DELAY) are inferred from the In/Out tables (the official param table skips 15 and 16); 0x10 out2 for NOISE is assumed (README lists OUT 1 twice). Verify against hardware."
  ],
